{
  "$schema": "../schema/component.schema.json",
  "id": "line-shadow-text",
  "title": "线条阴影文字",
  "description": "用于给插槽文字添加斜线条纹阴影装饰的静态文字效果组件。",
  "category": "effect",
  "tags": [
    "css",
    "tailwind",
    "magic-ui"
  ],
  "platforms": [
    "web"
  ],
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "shadowColor",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "阴影颜色。",
      "default": "\"black\""
    },
    {
      "name": "as",
      "type": "keyof HTMLElement",
      "required": false,
      "description": "根元素标签。",
      "default": "\"span\" as keyof HTMLElement"
    },
    {
      "name": "class",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "根节点类名。"
    },
    {
      "name": "text",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "文字内容，同时作为阴影层（data-text）的来源；不传时从默认插槽的纯文本中提取"
    }
  ],
  "events": [],
  "slots": [
    {
      "name": "default",
      "props": "() => VNode[]",
      "description": "正文，应为纯文本；不填时渲染 text"
    }
  ],
  "exposes": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Web 演示",
      "path": "app/components/reborn/examples/line-shadow-text/LineShadowTextDemo.vue",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web",
      "code": "<template>\n  <DemoSection title=\"基础用法\">\n    <DemoBlock\n      layout=\"stack\"\n      align=\"center\"\n    >\n      <h1 class=\"text-highlighted text-8xl leading-none font-extrabold tracking-tighter text-balance\">\n        快速\n        <LineShadowText\n          class=\"italic\"\n          shadow-color=\"var(--ui-text-highlighted)\"\n        >\n          上线\n        </LineShadowText>\n      </h1>\n    </DemoBlock>\n  </DemoSection>\n</template>\n"
    }
  ],
  "related": [],
  "whenToUse": [
    "大号标题中需要突出个别单词的装饰效果时。",
    "希望文字效果不含持续动画、渲染开销低的场景。"
  ],
  "whenNotToUse": [
    "需要扫过式高光动画，改用 radiant-text。",
    "需要闪烁粒子点缀文字，改用 sparkles-text。"
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "仅 web 端可用。",
    "shadowColor 默认 black，暗色模式下需切换为浅色（示例中根据 useColorMode 动态传入）。",
    "默认渲染为 span，可用 as prop 改为其他 HTML 标签。",
    "text 显式指定阴影文字；不传时在渲染期间提取默认插槽的文本，组件节点内部文字不参与提取，复杂正文应传 text。"
  ],
  "dependencies": [],
  "install": {
    "cli": "npx reborn-ui@latest add line-shadow-text"
  },
  "sourceRefs": {
